OL,3,GNEWSASchools and hospitals to display
OL,4,Agovernment art
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtwork that once adorned government
OL,7,Fbuildings and embassies across the
OL,8,Fglobe will be offered to schools and
OL,9,Fhospitals for the first time.
OL,11,FArts Minister Ruth Mackenzie visited
OL,12,FRoyal Stoke University Hospital and St
OL,13,FGregory's Catholic Academy in
OL,14,FStoke-on-Trent on Friday to launch the
OL,15,Finitiative.
OL,17,FPieces from the Government Art
OL,18,FCollection will be loaned for up to
OL,19,Ffive years, in a bid to break down
OL,20,Fbarriers to accessing British art and
OL,21,Fculture.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
