OL,3,GNEWSASchools and hospitals to display
OL,4,Agovernment art
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project will see 2,000 artworks
OL,7,Fbeing brought into as many as 500
OL,8,Fschools and 400 NHS hospitals and
OL,9,Fhealthcare settings across England by
OL,10,Fspring next year.
